      {
        "id": 122772,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-11T01:46:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In particular, there was a rush of topics about GSF at one point and I wanted a way to quickly mark them all read, but I couldn't do that as easily as I would have liked because some of the Topics about GSF were in the General forum.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is also related to the issue of not having to see everything that pops up. RIght now, you can't turn off specific area, rules, or topics.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, separate forum for forum games that you can not have show up.</p>",
